WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.475
Living things are sorted into kingdoms by features you can observe.

2
00:00:05.476 --> 00:00:09.376
Let's sort a kangaroo by its features, one question at a time.

3
00:00:11.441 --> 00:00:15.566
Does it make its own food using sunlight? No. It eats grass.

4
00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:21.609
Does it absorb its food from dead material, like a fungus? No.

5
00:00:24.806 --> 00:00:28.956
It eats other living things, so it belongs in the animal kingdom.

6
00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:34.636
Kingdoms sort by features; DNA shows which living things are really related.
